{% comment %}
WILD BEANS — STORY + TEAM (Editorial Left-Aligned, Limited Width)
{% endcomment %}

<section id="wild-beans-story-team" class="w-screen space-y-32 py-16 sm:py-32">

  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- CHAPTER 1 : THE INTUITION -->
  <!-- =============================== -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl pl-4 sm:pl-10">

    <h2
      class="pt-32 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight mb-10
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:150ms;"
    >
      OUR STORY
    </h2>

    <p
      class="text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:300ms;"
    >
      Wild Beans was born from a simple observation made by Vincent Rousseau on ad production sets:
      long days, tight schedules, and rarely a truly good cup of coffee. Before launching Wild Beans,
      Vincent had already founded 
      <a href="https://www.betterbewild.fr/paris" target="_blank" class="underline">
        Better Be Wild
      </a>,
      a Paris-based production company known for its ambitious creative direction and seamless on-set
      organization.
    </p>

  </div>

  <!-- CH1 IMAGES -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl pl-4 sm:pl-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

    <img
      src="{{ section.settings.story_img_1 | img_url: '1600x' }}"
      alt="Better Be Wild – Production"
      class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 w-full shadow-lg
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:450ms;"
    />

    <img
      src="{{ section.settings.story_img_2 | img_url: '1600x' }}"
      alt="Behind the scenes – Vincent Rousseau"
      class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 w-full shadow-lg
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:600ms;"
    />

  </div>


  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- CHAPTER 2 : THE MEETING -->
  <!-- =============================== -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl pl-4 sm:pl-10">

    <p
      class="text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:150ms;"
    >
      The project reached a new level when Vincent met Tom Darval, a barista with over thirteen years
      in specialty coffee. Known for his mastery of sourcing, roasting profiles, extraction techniques,
      and coffee culture, Tom brought the technical depth Wild Beans needed. Beyond his work with
      Wild Beans, he is currently filming a documentary series with Arte.
    </p>

  </div>

  <!-- CH2 IMAGE -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl pl-4 sm:pl-10 space-y-4">

    <img
      src="{{ section.settings.tom_doc_img | img_url: '1600x' }}"
      alt="Tom Darval filming Arte documentary"
      class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-96 w-full shadow-lg
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:300ms;"
    />

    <p
      class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500 italic
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:450ms;"
    >
      Tom filming his documentary series with Arte, capturing stories from the world of coffee.
    </p>

  </div>


  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- CHAPTER 3 : ON-SET EXPERTISE -->
  <!-- =============================== -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl pl-4 sm:pl-10">

    <p
      class="text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:150ms;"
    >
      With their complementary strengths — Vincent’s understanding of on-set realities and Tom’s
      specialty coffee expertise — Wild Beans evolved into a premium coffee service created specifically
      for shoots and production events.
    </p>

  </div>


  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- CHAPTER 4 : THE FUTURE -->
  <!-- =============================== -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl pl-4 sm:pl-10">

    <p
      class="text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:150ms;"
    >
      Looking ahead, Wild Beans is expanding through two major projects: our own coffee line, and BEANS —
      a media project and YouTube channel exploring global coffee culture.
    </p>

  </div>

  <!-- FUTURE LINKS -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl pl-4 sm:pl-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">

    <a href="/collections/all" class="group block">

      <img
        src="{{ section.settings.brand_img | img_url: '1600x' }}"
        alt="Wild Beans Coffee – Our Products"
        class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-72 w-full shadow-lg
               opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out group-hover:opacity-90"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:300ms;"
      />

      <p
        class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mt-2
               opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:350ms;"
      >
        Discover Wild Beans Coffee →
      </p>

    </a>

    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@BEANS_TOMDARVAL" target="_blank" class="group block">

      <img
        src="{{ section.settings.youtube_img | img_url: '1600x' }}"
        alt="Beans – YouTube Channel"
        class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-72 w-full shadow-lg
               opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out group-hover:opacity-90"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:400ms;"
      />

      <p
        class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mt-2
               opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:450ms;"
      >
        Explore Beans on YouTube →
      </p>

    </a>

  </div>


  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- TEAM SECTION -->
  <!-- =============================== -->
  <div class="w-2/3 pl-4 sm:pl-10 space-y-12 content-center">

    <h2
      class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight
             opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-[1200ms] ease-out"
      data-scroll-fade
      style="transition-delay:150ms;"
    >
      THE WILD BEANS TEAM
    </h2>

    <div class="w-full flex flex-col justify-center md:grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3">

      <!-- VINCENT -->
      <article
        class="group flex flex-col items-start text-left
               rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/60 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm
               p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2
               transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:250ms;"
      >
        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.vincent_image | img_url: '600x' }}"
          alt="Portrait of Vincent Rousseau"
          class="h-96 w-96 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md ring-2 ring-neutral-100 mb-6"
        />

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold uppercase">VINCENT ROUSSEAU</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-500 mb-4">
          FOUNDER & PRODUCTION LEAD
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base uppercase leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
          Vincent leads operations, planning, logistics, and on-set coordination.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- TOM -->
      <article
        class="group flex flex-col items-start text-left
               rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/60 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm
               p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2
               transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:350ms;"
      >
        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.tom_image | img_url: '600x' }}"
          alt="Portrait of Tom Darval"
          class="h-96 w-96 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md ring-2 ring-neutral-100 mb-6"
        />

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold uppercase">TOM DARVAL</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-500 mb-4">
          HEAD OF COFFEE & EXPERIENCE
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base uppercase leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
          Tom defines the coffee direction, bean selection, training, and standards.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- PB -->
      <article
  class="group flex flex-col items-center text-left 
                rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/60 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm
                p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2
                transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6"
  data-scroll-fade
  style="transition-delay:250ms;"
>
        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.pb_image | img_url: '600x' }}"
          alt="Portrait of Pierre-Baptiste Rozic"
          class="h-96 w-96 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md ring-2 ring-neutral-100 mb-6"
        />

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold uppercase">PIERRE-BAPTISTE ROZIC</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-500 mb-4">
          BARISTA & LOGISTICS SUPPORT
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base uppercase leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
          Supports bar service, logistics, and setup throughout production days.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Wild Beans – Story",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "story_img_1", "label": "Story image 1" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "story_img_2", "label": "Story image 2" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "tom_doc_img", "label": "Tom documentary image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "brand_img", "label": "Brand image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "youtube_img", "label": "YouTube image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "vincent_image", "label": "Vincent image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "tom_image", "label": "Tom image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "pb_image", "label": "PB image" }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Wild Beans – Story + Team (Editorial Left, Limited Width)" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
